# Victory Road (the new road to the League, through the old road's ruins, over falls and through the mountain): a horn's urgent
# tune in D minor over driving plucked strings, held strings, a timpani bass and a pressing kit. The caves play the same by day
# and by night. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U9, part b).
